<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Additional Bank refers to a financial institution that acknowledges the Amended Credit Agreement and participates in the agreement by making independent credit decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Additional Bank shall constitute a Bank under the Amended Credit Agreement."</data>
