</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Agent acts on behalf of the banks in managing administrative functions related to the credit agreement and its amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agent is responsible for ensuring the conditions precedent are met for the Amendment to be effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agent is the entity that represents the lenders and oversees the administrative functions of the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58598f70b5a253429401f1f1c4a79734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d1bc953975fdc876f33628f400261e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3d2193e53925a8976a993ed85a696df</data>
