<node id="&quot;EXISTING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Existing Credit Agreement is the prior contract that is being amended by Amendment No. 2, detailing the arrangements prior to August 29, 2024."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Existing Credit Agreement serves as the foundation document outlining the initial terms prior to any amendments made to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Existing Credit Agreement, as amended by this Amendment, is referred to herein as the 'Amended Credit Agreement'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original credit agreement that is referenced and amended by the Amendment."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the previously established credit agreement that is being referenced and affirmed by the Borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3d2193e53925a8976a993ed85a696df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ef11f13cda702c217a04f82ce77965d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6deecefaeb7e3a0fdb52f9ca6b11ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdadc02546029dea7800ee5f9c31dc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58598f70b5a253429401f1f1c4a79734</data>
