<node id="&quot;AMENDED CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CFSC hereby reaffirms all of its obligations under Article IX of the Amended Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Amended Credit Agreement refers to the revised contract that includes terms reaffirmed by the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Amended Credit Agreement serves as a legal contract outlining terms agreed upon by the parties involved, including banks and borrowers under its structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Existing Credit Agreement, as amended by this Amendment, is referred to herein as the 'Amended Credit Agreement'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The revised version of the Existing Credit Agreement incorporating the terms of the Amendment."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Amendment acknowledges and agrees that it has received a copy of the Amended Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-83d1bc953975fdc876f33628f400261e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3d2193e53925a8976a993ed85a696df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6deecefaeb7e3a0fdb52f9ca6b11ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdadc02546029dea7800ee5f9c31dc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3297117ba565b80ed2032999083df511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58598f70b5a253429401f1f1c4a79734</data>
